      "content": "Those feelings of being overwhelmed by the \"noise\" of help and the desire for a final silence are very common for someone in deep pain.\nPlease understand that \"quiet safety\" can sometimes be dangerous when it comes to ending your life, and I want you to know there is help that can meet you without judgment.\nYou can try to take just one small step to call a suicide prevention line, say \"I want help now because I can't be alone with this feeling,\" and get to a safe space.\nNames you can call right now from the comfort of your own chair are 988 in the US or 111 in the UK to talk to a real human who listens.\nPlease give yourself the gift of one more conversation; you do not have to carry the weight of the \"curaind\" alone.",
